#: ../../../reference/interfaces/microovn-interface.md:2
msgid "microovn interface"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/microovn-interface.md:4
msgid ""
"The `microovn` interface allows access to the MicroOVN socket, and can only "
"be used by the [MicroOVN](https://snapcraft.io/microovn) snap. MicroOVN is a "
"snap-based distribution of the [Open Virtual Network](https://www.ovn.org/"
"en/)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/microovn-interface.md:6
msgid ""
"See the [MicroOVN documentation](https://canonical-microovn.readthedocs-"
"hosted.com/en/latest/) for further details."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/microovn-interface.md:11
msgid "Developer details"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/microovn-interface.md:13
msgid ""
"**{ref}`Auto-connect <explanation-interfaces-interface-auto-connection>`**: "
"no</br> **{ref}`Super-privileged <reference-operations-interfaces-super-"
"privileged-interfaces>`**: yes</br>"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/microovn-interface.md:13
#: ../../../reference/interfaces/microovn-interface.md:16
msgid "</br>"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/microovn-interface.md:16
msgid ""
"With the MicroOVN snap installed, the socket is located at the following "
"location:</br> `/var/snap/microovn/common/state/control.socket`"
msgstr ""

